    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_02",
      "hash64": "794C3BF237DE32D5",
      "text": "Te agradezco el apoyo que has brindado al club\\ny, en especial, todo lo que has hecho por Cass.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_03",
      "hash64": "794C3AF237DE3122",
      "text": "Ahora que te has convertido en Campe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ónona,\\nCass ha decidido retirarse de la clasificación.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_04",
      "hash64": "794C35F237DE28A3",
      "text": "Es un poco triste, pero tampoco significa que\\nvayamos a dejar de vernos.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_05",
      "hash64": "794C34F237DE26F0",
      "text": "Ante todo, me hace muy feliz ver que vuelve\\na ser el mismo de antes.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_06",
      "hash64": "794C37F237DE2C09",
      "text": "La alegría me ha embargado tanto que he\\npreparado cuantiosas unidades del suplemento\\r\\nque permite volar para participar en mi reto.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_12",
      "hash64": "7948B1F237DB1280",
      "text": "Cuando desees surcar los cielos, dale a don Rai\\nla cantidad acorde a las necesidades.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_01",
      "hash64": "0D2282BD495E0C0C",
      "text": "¿Rai?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_02",
      "hash64": "0D2285BD495E1125",
      "text": "Ñam, ñam...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_13",
      "hash64": "7948B2F237DB1433",
      "text": "Ah... ¿ahora? Pero ingerir todo a la vez no es\\nel procedimiento adecua...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_legend_03",
      "hash64": "0D2284BD495E0F72",
      "text": "¡Raaai!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_system_01",
      "hash64": "1EA3E8AF2CA275D4",
      "text": "¡Nueva técnica de desplazamiento!\\n¡[VAR 0x0101(0001)] ahora puede volar!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_07",
      "hash64": "794C36F237DE2A56",
      "text": "Si no me equivoco... se diría que sus cualidades\\nse han visto potenciadas.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_08",
      "hash64": "794C41F237DE3D07",
      "text": "A juzgar por las apariencias, deduzco que ahora\\npodría volar de forma continuada, ¿no es así?\\r\\nBien, podemos dar carpetazo a esta cuestión...[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_09",
      "hash64": "794C40F237DE3B54",
      "text": "He ideado un nuevo recorrido de suma dificultad\\npara el vuelo contrarreloj.\\c\\nSi te ves capaz, no dudes en ponerte a prueba.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_10",
      "hash64": "7948B3F237DB15E6",
      "text": "Si logras superar el nivel difícil del vuelo\\ncontrarreloj, podrás afrontar el nivel ultradifícil:\\r\\nun desafío de mayores proporciones aún.\\c\\nTe animo a medir tu valía si te ves con confianza.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 194,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0048"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_039_steel_11",
      "hash64": "7948B4F237DB1799",
      "text": "Es hora de irme. Adiós.[VAR 0x0114(0048)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
